[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitdirshadowfade"]

; Moves the distance fade. A short `directional_shadow_max_distance` ends the sun's shadow part-way
; along seven posts: the near posts cast, the fade thins the next and the far ones cast nothing. The
; sun is orthogonal, so no split selection shapes the row. Every other shadow golden keeps its
; casters well inside its shadow range, where the fade never reaches.

